# Rules evidence

When editing modeled Magic semantics (patterns, executor, verifier gates) or
tests/eval that encode those claims: **memory proposes; sources decide**.

1. Read [`docs/RULES_EVIDENCE.md`](../../docs/RULES_EVIDENCE.md) for authority roles
   and citation format.
2. Load the project skill [`.agents/skills/rules-evidence/SKILL.md`](../../.agents/skills/rules-evidence/SKILL.md)
   when the change adds executor primitives or changes what `VERIFIED` requires.
3. Do **not** use Spellbook (or memory alone) to justify `VERIFIED` semantics
   (ADR 0001 / 0003). Expand coverage deliberately with tests and docs.

**Authority:** [`docs/RULES_EVIDENCE.md`](../../docs/RULES_EVIDENCE.md), [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md).
